          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EMost sites use a fraction of what their CMS can do. Editors learn the few steps they need on day one and rarely look further. Meanwhile, features that would save hours every week go unused. This session shows what you are missing.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe walk through the features editors and site owners most often overlook. These include scheduled publishing, reusable content blocks, previews and version history. We also cover permissions and workflows that keep content consistent across a team. Every example comes from real sites we have worked on.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBring your questions: the last part of the session is open discussion. You will leave with a short list of changes you can make straight away. No technical background is needed.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "settingsData": [],
